        "response": "[Awaiting tool approval]\n\n**Policy:** Shell command approval (skills demo)\nAbout to run a shell command in the agent workspace. Approve to continue?\n**Required Tools:** run_command\n```python\ncorrect_output = await run_command(\"cd workspace/scripts && python summarize_sales.py\")\nprint(correct_output)\n\nhas_error = \"Traceback\" in correct_output or \"Error\" in correct_output\nprint(f\"Contains error: {has_error}\")\nprint(f\"Output length: {len(correct_output)}\")\n\nsave_result = await write_file(\"workspace/docs/sales_summary.txt\", correct_output)\nprint(save_result)\n\nfinal_content = await read_file(\"workspace/docs/sales_summary.txt\")\nprint(final_content)\n```",
